{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And it was told to Joseph.</b> One of the tellers — and this is an elliptical verse. And there are those who say: Ephraim was regularly before Jacob in study, and when Jacob fell ill in the land of Goshen, Ephraim went to his father in Egypt to tell him." "<b>And he took his two sons with him.</b> So that Jacob would bless them before his death."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:03:52.565642569Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}